            "type": "mcq",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 25–30</h3><p>Choose the correct letter, <strong>A</strong>, <strong>B</strong> or <strong>C</strong>.</p>",
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 25,
                "textHtml": "What does the woman say about using laptops to teach writing to children with dyslexia?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "Children often lack motivation to learn that way"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "Children become fluent relatively quickly"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "Children react more positively if they make a mistake"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 26,
                "textHtml": "When discussing whether to teach cursive or print writing, the woman thinks that",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "cursive writing disadvantages a certain group of children"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "print writing is associated with lower academic performance"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "most teachers in the UK prefer a traditional approach to handwriting"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 27,
                "textHtml": "According to the students, what impact does poor handwriting have on exam performance?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "There is evidence to suggest grades are affected by poor handwriting"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "Neat handwriting is less important now than it used to be"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "Candidates write more slowly and produce shorter answers"
                  }
